@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Domain NotFound -> 404 application/problem+json
GET {{base}}/rooms/0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001

### Path rejection -> 400
GET {{base}}/rooms/abc

### Query rejection -> 400
GET {{base}}/rooms?minCapacity=x

### Body rejection (no Content-Type) -> 415
POST {{base}}/rooms

{}

### Validation -> 422 with errors map
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "capacity": 0}

### Domain invariant -> 422
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "   ", "capacity": 3}

### Referenced room does not exist -> 422 (field roomId)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId": "0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "userId": "0199a3f0-0000-7000-8000-000000000007", "startTime": "2026-10-05T09:00:00Z", "endTime": "2026-10-05T10:00:00Z"}

### Method not allowed -> 405
DELETE {{base}}/bookings

### Unknown route -> 404
GET {{base}}/nope
